A full generic arc_loop_solve sweep over the 25 public games banked ONE new level: lf52 L1, via
graph_explore_solve_v2 adapter-free (8 ACTION6 clicks), reproduction-gated AND independently
ground-truth-replayed (level 0->1 on a fresh env, 2026-06-20). lf52 was previously one of the 3
unsolved games (no registry entry; the conductor's .413 first-contact had not banked it). Registered
+ seed/verifier checkpoints captured. Unsolved frontier 3 -> 2 (re86, bp35 remain -- both need
per-game RE: re86 a missing sprite-resize verifier, bp35 a goal-directed navigation solver per
docs/research-notes/arc-bp35-re-2026-06-20.md). Header total left for the conductor's hygiene reconcile.

